Contract correction from the WT-S revision after QA reject 1. Plan against revised §1.6, §1.7 and §1.9 in docs/plans/2026-10-30-per-task-worktrees.md.
A W where `W/.moe` exists (a link counts) is never removed:
- the QA DONE removal skips it;
- it is not a sweep candidate;
- it waits for a human with its bytes intact.
Add a negative case: a DONE task that is fully landed and has `W/.moe/x` present keeps both W and its task branch.
